    "body": "It looks like curl error code 23 is caused by not being able to write the tmp file.\n\nCan you try running the following commands and post the response \n\n```\ncurl --fail --silent --location --output /tmp/tmp.zh6cLQDzF5.zip https://github.com/starship/starship/releases/latest/download/starship-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip\n\ntouch $(mktemp) \n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
